    "body": "`modinv_var` in section 7 of doc/safegcd_implementation.md calls `normalize(f, d, Mi)`, but `normalize` takes the modulus `M`. As written it returns the right inverse for 1 of 2008 inputs; with `M`, for all 2008.\n",
