      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "The two Wine jobs fail because `ubuntu-latest` is now ubuntu-26.04: every test exits with `wine: socket : Function not implemented`. The last green Wine jobs, on master on 2026-11-04 and on PRs up to 2026-11-06, ran on ubuntu-24.04, so master and other PRs should hit this too. Pinning `mingw_debian` to `ubuntu-24.04` would be one way out.\n",
